---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import GhostWord from '../components/GhostWord.astro';
---

<Base
  title="About — 刘启征"
  description="Digital Media Technology student in Suzhou — posters, short films and AI visual pipelines."
>
  <section class="page-head wrap">
    <GhostWord text="About" />
    <h1 class="t-display">
      <span class="line-mask"><span style="--i:0">About—</span></span>
    </h1>
  </section>

  <section class="wrap about-grid">
    <div class="prose" data-reveal>
      <p class="lede">
        I'm 刘启征 (Lin), studying Digital Media Technology at Suzhou Chien-Shiung
        Institute of Technology. I spend most of my time making posters, editing short
        films and pushing AI tools until they behave like a real production pipeline.
      </p>
      <p class="cn">
        我是刘启征，苏州健雄职业技术学院数字媒体技术在读。大部分时间在做海报、剪片子，
        以及把 AI 工具调教到能真正干活的程度。
      </p>
      <p>
        I came to design from curiosity rather than a formal art background. That
        means I learned typography from looking, and tooling from breaking things.
        It also means I care a lot about <em>how</em> something is made, not only
        how it looks.
      </p>
      <p>
        Right now I'm interested in one question: when generation becomes cheap, what
        is still expensive? My answer so far — taste, consistency, and the discipline
        to throw away 90% of the output.
      </p>

      <h3>What I can do</h3>
      <p>
        Poster &amp; layout design · short-form video editing · AI image generation
        pipelines (ComfyUI / Stable Diffusion) · basic front-end (HTML/CSS/JS).
      </p>

      <h3>Currently</h3>
      <p>Open to internships, collaborations and commissioned poster work.</p>
    </div>

    <aside class="about-aside" data-reveal style="--d:1">
      <div>
        <h4>Based in</h4>
        <p>苏州 Suzhou, China</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h4>Studying</h4>
        <p>Digital Media Technology<br />Suzhou Chien-Shiung Institute of Technology</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h4>Focus</h4>
        <p>Poster · Film · AI Visual</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h4>Available for</h4>
        <p>Freelance &amp; internship</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h4>Contact</h4>
        <p>
          <a class="link-u" href="mailto:Linqingzhu0420@gmail.com" data-cursor="hover"
            >Linqingzhu0420@gmail.com</a
          >
        </p>
      </div>
    </aside>
  </section>
</Base>
